PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786960091
OL,3,CWife killer Glyn Razzell to remain in
OL,4,Cprison after High Court ruling
OL,6,FThe Parole Board ruled Razzell could
OL,7,Fbe released on licence in April, but
OL,8,Fthe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) referred
OL,9,Fthe decision to the High Court.
OL,11,FAt a hearing earlier this week,
OL,12,Fbarristers for the MoJ said the Parole
OL,13,FBoard had failed to assess Razzell's
OL,14,Frisk properly, and that the decision
OL,15,Fto free him should be reversed.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
