OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786960091
OL,3,CWife killer Glyn Razzell to remain in
OL,4,Cprison after High Court ruling
OL,6,FMrs Razzell's relatives and loved ones
OL,7,Falso urged the court to block the
OL,8,Frelease, with her cousin Julie
OL,9,FWestmore saying the family "will not
OL,10,Ffeel safe" and expressing fear that
OL,11,F"all hope of ever finding Linda's
OL,12,Fremains will be lost" if the killer is
OL,13,Ffreed.
OL,15,FRazzell, who attended the hearing in
OL,16,FLondon, opposed the move, with his
OL,17,Fbarristers telling the court that
OL,18,Fthere was no basis to overturn the
OL,19,Fdecision.
OL,26,@qD@\OUrD@JO]sD@AOUtD@UO]
