PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786960091
OL,3,CWife killer Glyn Razzell to remain in
OL,4,Cprison after High Court ruling
OL,6,FIn a ruling on Friday, Mrs Justice
OL,7,FCheema-Grubb quashed the Parole
OL,8,FBoard's decision, stating that she was
OL,9,F"not satisfied that it is no longer
OL,10,Fnecessary for the protection of the
OL,11,Fpublic that Glyn Razzell be confined".
OL,13,FShe said: "I am not persuaded that the
OL,14,Frisk has diminished to such a level
OL,15,Fthat offender management is capable of
OL,16,Fkeeping the public safe if the
OL,17,Fdefendant is released."
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@eO]uD@KOUyD@WO]
